<description>&lt;p&gt;A Mexican judge was arrested on U.S. charges of accepting a $2 million bribe to free a drug trafficker linked to former Olympian Ryan Wedding. A man extradited from Mexico was sentenced to 20 years for a fatal Longview shooting, and vehicle pursuits from Riverside County ended in officer-involved shootings near the U.S.-Mexico border. A serial rapist extradited from Mexico was convicted for murders committed in 2002, and intelligence agencies reported an alleged Mexican-Dawood cartel nexus targeting India. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE5iclB2X0lBMjZVdlAwajVIc0RhaTItQTNTcFFLVmNiOTEzY1kxTEljUGY1TklUUjVTMk9DZjRNekl4TWZfQlhfbUdLMTA3dlEzUXRTczZUWXF4cEJLZ3hTMzZWTWFaU3hvN0tMYmVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;news.sbs.co.kr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNODBoaHkzTHZicnp4dkpYQkdoX2VGYllNRzRJVVN4ZEplMHNuM3NyRElWMzhGajJPWmJ6RGMwdm9oWGROUkFOVV8yZHJFOXpoZW1PUWFxd0NRRHd0alNhMUlQcDBsRDFSenFDbVFYQkVDYW5jcm1YRk5VSW9xVjlRT2lKR3JzUUFkMXRxZzhPX1phWlF6bkN3RUpnSzY3N20xaWVWeTJRMXdtUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KETK.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOTEhnMmdXWmh4YVlNeEd6dnMzcXRZR3RPMzRxdkdrWEJVUDJsTmMwcFVGZFNicjlTeXQxNEtPdUUzYnU4a2k2YjBOS25QOWZvUndxZ3dFMWttbVNfdlQzTllEUmt3VVBGMFpadmpKdkhrUzg5OWstV09ocGNSX3FLbEdpNEItM3FTRzZGZW1OdW5SR3h2Xy1Ndg?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNcmMwcEVvX1QydlRVN1pqLXZhU1RqR0ZDMWE1RWdyWWFpQjd5SXZlSGJkc2tLMEFIb19HWDlKbW9OMGlyRnh0QUxTNkExV3ZBT290U2lhVzZCdjFYeDFrWTZiZFQwRUVhUVJFaG04T2pnU2JYcVpmWG1OajF6SFJiYk9Cc0J